Homepage: https://github.com/vomlehn/tcspecial
Description: manuals and designs for tcspecial
 The TCS manuals and design documents, TCS Design and Documentation at their
 head, as HTML with their figures and screenshots, under
 /opt/tcs/share/doc/tcspecial-doc. Their figures are the examples'
 diagrams, which tcspecial-examples installs. Nothing a vehicle or a ground
 station needs to run.
